  m_text: "As ruler of a rising domain, your task is to build a thriving economy,
    expand your influence, and guide your people toward prosperity.\r\nYou have a
    limited number of turns to shape your empire before the arrival of the Grand
    Jubilee, a grand celebration of your nation's unity and culture.\r\nWhen the
    time comes, you will be responsible for organizing the festivities, placing grand
    entertainments across your lands to earn glory and acclaim.\r\nEvery decision
    you make will echo in that final celebration. Let\u2019s begin."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
